<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>星盤入門 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E6%98%9F%E7%9B%A4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80/</link><description>Recent content in 星盤入門 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E6%98%9F%E7%9B%A4%E5%85%A5%E9%96%80/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>第二宮與第八宮怎麼看？自己的資源與共同責任</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%AE%E8%88%87%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AB%E5%AE%AE%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E8%B3%87%E6%BA%90%E8%88%87%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB/</link><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%AC%AC%E4%BA%8C%E5%AE%AE%E8%88%87%E7%AC%AC%E5%85%AB%E5%AE%AE%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E7%9A%84%E8%B3%87%E6%BA%90%E8%88%87%E5%85%B1%E5%90%8C%E8%B2%AC%E4%BB%BB/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;分攤費用、共同買東西、照顧家人，常把「我有多少」和「我們各要負責什麼」混在一起。占星的第二宮與第八宮，適合拿來整理這兩類問題。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>第一宮與第七宮怎麼看？從自我走向合作</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%AE%E8%88%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%AE%AE%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E5%BE%9E%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%AE%E8%88%87%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%83%E5%AE%AE%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E7%9C%8B%E5%BE%9E%E8%87%AA%E6%88%91%E8%B5%B0%E5%90%91%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;讀星盤時，第一宮和第七宮落在兩端，常被簡化成「我」與「另一半」。如果你正在準備合作，這條軸線更有用的問法是：我怎麼開始一件事？又希望怎麼與人協調？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>